# Web accessibility

Follow `docs/standards/accessibility.md`.

- One `#main-content` per route. Do not drop the root skip link.
- Visible labels on inputs. Placeholders are not labels. Errors use `role="alert"`.
- Hit targets ≥ 44×44px. Icon-only controls need `aria-label`.
- No desktop-only reserved space below `lg` (side rails, `paddingLeft: 12.5rem`). Wrap with `min-w-0`.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`. Do not remove `:focus-visible` without a replacement ring.
- Guest-site palettes must keep body text ≥ 4.5:1.
